WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:14.514
{\an8}2010 YEAR, YOIDO, SEOUL

2
00:00:14.597 --> 00:00:15.765
Are you long?

3
00:00:16.766 --> 00:00:17.851
No, as always.

4
00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:21.688
I spoke with Choo Woon.

5
00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:25.191
He will take you
if everything goes well today.

6
00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:28.778
i will be back

7
00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:30.613
Brother

8
00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:33.700
Are you nervous?

9
00:00:57.348 --> 00:00:58.767
Hello, Kyoto.

10
00:01:00.185 --> 00:01:01.061
Enough.

11
00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:07.692
Well done.

12
00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.696
He is coming here.

13
00:03:13.651 --> 00:03:17.030
WITHOUT MERCY

14
00:03:26.998 --> 00:03:27.999
Well, because!

15
00:03:28.082 --> 00:03:29.250
What the hell?

16
00:03:30.668 --> 00:03:33.213
Devil. Damn bastards.

17
00:03:35.298 --> 00:03:36.132
Agov.

18
00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:38.885
Do you even know who you contacted?

19
00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:40.720
Untie me.

20
00:03:41.512 --> 00:03:42.639
Immediately!

21
00:03:43.681 --> 00:03:44.515
Ahoy!

22
00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:46.559
Where is Mr. Gu?

23
00:03:47.185 --> 00:03:49.520
Call Mr. Gu! I will talk to him!

24
00:03:52.607 --> 00:03:53.566
OK!

25
00:03:54.859 --> 00:03:58.029
I will double the amount of money
that Gu Jun Mo promised you.

26
00:03:58.112 --> 00:03:59.239
Double!

27
00:03:59.322 --> 00:04:01.199
Do you know what "double" means?

28
00:04:01.282 --> 00:04:02.242
How funny.

29
00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:06.663
That's exactly what Mr. Gu said, word for word.

30
00:04:07.914 --> 00:04:10.250
I also work for Bonsan!

31
00:04:20.009 --> 00:04:21.803
How long has it been since we've seen each other?

32
00:04:23.888 --> 00:04:26.432
You were just talking about a meeting.

33
00:04:28.434 --> 00:04:29.894
Many years.

34
00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:33.564
Let's sit down.

35
00:05:01.259 --> 00:05:03.511
Heard what happened to that manager, Cha?

36
00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:06.681
It was Jun Mo.

37
00:05:07.682 --> 00:05:09.350
My son did it.

38
00:05:11.602 --> 00:05:12.687
Peven, you know

39
00:05:14.397 --> 00:05:16.232
about his reputation in the company.

40
00:05:17.984 --> 00:05:22.488
Cha seems to have interfered in Jun Mo's affairs.

41
00:05:23.698 --> 00:05:26.409
And Jun Mo hired someone
to get revenge on him

42
00:05:27.702 --> 00:05:29.620
but they went too far.

43
00:05:32.582 --> 00:05:34.667
Those foreigners that Jun Mo brought

44
00:05:36.002 --> 00:05:37.628
take care of them please.

45
00:05:37.712 --> 00:05:40.340
why are you asking me This is your company.

46
00:05:40.423 --> 00:05:42.175
This is a family affair, not a company affair.

47
00:05:42.258 --> 00:05:44.260
He is not sinless, but he is my son.

48
00:05:44.886 --> 00:05:46.763
If I humiliate him,

49
00:05:47.764 --> 00:05:49.390
what will people think

50
00:05:49.474 --> 00:05:52.852
Anyway, why are you asking me?
This is your family.

51
00:05:55.772 --> 00:05:59.525
For this I offer help
in your question with the land plot.

52
00:06:00.026 --> 00:06:01.819
I, Gu Bong Sun,

53
00:06:03.446 --> 00:06:05.490
ready to take a loss-making deal.

54
00:06:16.501 --> 00:06:17.919
- Ah!
- We are leaving!

55
00:06:18.002 --> 00:06:18.836
Yes exactly!

56
00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:26.469
<i>Take care of Goo Bong San's case.</i>

57
00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:30.807
Sir, these are Bonsan Group problems.

58
00:06:34.018 --> 00:06:35.645
your truth

59
00:06:36.687 --> 00:06:37.563
But Gi Suk

60
00:06:39.273 --> 00:06:41.609
he will decide for that
our problem with the plot in Yoido.

61
00:06:42.193 --> 00:06:44.112
So now that's our problem.

62
00:06:44.195 --> 00:06:46.114
{\an8}NAM GI SOK
DIRECTOR OF CHUVUN GROUP

63
00:06:46.197 --> 00:06:48.032
Why don't you ask Choi Song Chol?

64
00:06:49.367 --> 00:06:50.201
what are you

65
00:06:51.285 --> 00:06:53.079
are you serious

66
00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:59.043
I said so. After me, you are next.

67
00:07:01.212 --> 00:07:03.714
Why do you suddenly want to leave the company?

68
00:07:10.263 --> 00:07:13.683
Gi Soku, this is your business.

69
00:07:14.392 --> 00:07:16.185
And all this will come in handy,

70
00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:19.313
when you will manage the company.

71
00:07:22.358 --> 00:07:24.152
I checked what you requested.

72
00:07:24.235 --> 00:07:26.863
Gu Jun Mo's reputation
in "Bonsan" nowhere.

73
00:07:28.364 --> 00:07:31.784
So much so that he had to
hire people from abroad.

74
00:07:32.201 --> 00:07:33.870
{\an8}CHEON HYE BOM
"CHUVUN"

75
00:07:33.953 --> 00:07:34.954
Are you all right?

76
00:07:36.664 --> 00:07:38.833
And what? Looks like no?

77
00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:42.378
No, sir.

78
00:07:42.462 --> 00:07:43.463
Sorry.

79
00:07:45.381 --> 00:07:46.257
Hey Bom.

80
00:07:50.887 --> 00:07:54.390
What do you want to do when you quit?

81
00:07:55.808 --> 00:07:56.767
Sorry?

82
00:08:04.233 --> 00:08:07.612
<i>I'm much better off without this Cha.</i>

83
00:08:07.695 --> 00:08:08.738
{\an8}DE'CRO HOTEL

84
00:08:09.614 --> 00:08:10.615
Agov, Okure.

85
00:08:11.199 --> 00:08:12.033
Well done.

86
00:08:13.826 --> 00:08:15.828
Sir, here comes Nam Gi Seok…

87
00:08:16.621 --> 00:08:17.538
Everything is fine.

88
00:08:18.331 --> 00:08:19.165
Let him come in.

89
00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:33.262
You have three days.

90
00:08:34.388 --> 00:08:35.723
Fly to the homeland.

91
00:08:37.892 --> 00:08:41.854
It seems you caused trouble there too,
but it is not safer here.

92
00:08:43.189 --> 00:08:44.398
Better go from here.

93
00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:46.859
What kind of cholera?

94
00:08:51.322 --> 00:08:52.281
Director Name.

95
00:08:52.949 --> 00:08:54.659
Why is the person from Chuvun here?

96
00:08:55.493 --> 00:08:57.703
I'm asking you. What did you forget here?

97
00:08:58.371 --> 00:09:01.541
Mr. Gu personally asked Mr. Li.

98
00:09:02.917 --> 00:09:04.544
Because he is such a successful businessman

99
00:09:05.461 --> 00:09:07.296
ready to suffer losses for his son

100
00:09:08.548 --> 00:09:10.841
and step over your own pride.

101
00:09:10.925 --> 00:09:12.301
{\an8}GU JUNG MO, DIRECTOR OF BONSAN

102
00:09:12.385 --> 00:09:13.302
Mr. Director.

103
00:09:14.053 --> 00:09:16.681
If you don't know how, it's better not to do it.

104
00:09:18.808 --> 00:09:21.227
It will be better for you, sir.

105
00:09:28.234 --> 00:09:30.319
"If you don't know how, don't do it"?

106
00:09:33.197 --> 00:09:34.532
Well, what...

107
00:09:36.867 --> 00:09:39.328
As a director, you have the right to say so.

108
00:09:40.705 --> 00:09:43.791
Your brother did it, didn't he?

109
00:09:45.251 --> 00:09:46.419
So how now...

110
00:09:48.963 --> 00:09:49.839
his leg

111
00:09:51.299 --> 00:09:52.717
<i>What is Gi Seok doing there?</i>

112
00:09:53.342 --> 00:09:54.176
<i>Excuse me?</i>

113
00:09:55.553 --> 00:09:56.762
Ah, what about Gi Seok?

114
00:09:58.222 --> 00:09:59.599
went to Gu now?

115
00:09:59.682 --> 00:10:02.143
<i>Yes, that's why he came.</i>

116
00:10:02.685 --> 00:10:03.561
grandfather

117
00:10:04.437 --> 00:10:07.315
You shouldn't have let him go, jerks!

118
00:10:07.398 --> 00:10:08.774
Ten years have passed?

119
00:10:09.275 --> 00:10:11.235
Oh, and they made a mess then.

120
00:10:12.486 --> 00:10:14.947
It would be better if he did everything your way then.

121
00:10:15.031 --> 00:10:18.117
Unfortunately, he didn't listen. Like me now.

122
00:10:19.744 --> 00:10:23.581
Then my father and Mr. Lee Choo Woon
managed to clean up the mess after him.

123
00:10:24.915 --> 00:10:29.003
But he was left alive.
Only the Achilles tendon was cut.

124
00:10:33.549 --> 00:10:37.511
And his brother is still living off Chu Wong.

125
00:10:38.888 --> 00:10:40.765
How inconvenient.

126
00:10:53.027 --> 00:10:54.320
Mr. Name.

127
00:10:55.196 --> 00:10:57.573
Am I doing the right thing or not...

128
00:11:01.035 --> 00:11:02.286
what to you What are the problems?

129
00:11:03.204 --> 00:11:04.246
What...

130
00:11:12.254 --> 00:11:13.089
you

131
00:11:14.423 --> 00:11:15.591
You are the problem.

132
00:11:22.264 --> 00:11:23.224
Agov.

133
00:11:24.475 --> 00:11:25.685
Nam Gi Suk!

134
00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:29.772
You just crossed the line!

135
00:12:12.732 --> 00:12:13.566
How cold

136
00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:25.119
Fits well.

137
00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:32.460
Won't you ask?

138
00:12:35.463 --> 00:12:36.297
What?

139
00:12:39.175 --> 00:12:41.260
"How are you doing?"

140
00:12:41.343 --> 00:12:43.721
"Do you have a girlfriend?" Ordinary things.

141
00:12:44.972 --> 00:12:46.974
We haven't seen each other in six years.

142
00:12:49.643 --> 00:12:51.187
The director wants me to…

143
00:12:53.481 --> 00:12:55.357
headed "Zhuvun" after him.

144
00:12:56.942 --> 00:12:58.652
Doesn't that make you happy?

145
00:13:02.865 --> 00:13:05.743
I don't know if it's really good.

146
00:13:08.913 --> 00:13:10.623
Maybe I should work here too?

147
00:13:19.757 --> 00:13:20.883
I have to go now.

148
00:13:40.611 --> 00:13:41.862
is everything ok

149
00:13:43.197 --> 00:13:44.490
I thought you wouldn't ask.

150
00:14:00.923 --> 00:14:05.386
CHUVUN COMPANY
CORPORATE GALLERY

151
00:15:00.774 --> 00:15:01.609
Get out already.

152
00:15:14.538 --> 00:15:16.081
why do you always come

153
00:15:18.459 --> 00:15:21.253
Of course, because you have nowhere to go.

154
00:15:31.597 --> 00:15:32.723
Who sent you?

155
00:15:34.224 --> 00:15:35.601
You're gone, bastard!

156
00:15:38.812 --> 00:15:40.022
Cattle.

157
00:15:47.071 --> 00:15:48.447
Is this Gu Jun Mo?

158
00:15:51.408 --> 00:15:52.743
Is it Director Gu himself?

159
00:15:56.205 --> 00:15:58.832
Although I think that you do not know.

160
00:16:00.668 --> 00:16:01.543
get up

161
00:16:03.879 --> 00:16:04.964
Ahoy!

162
00:16:41.583 --> 00:16:42.418
Bastard!

163
00:16:43.002 --> 00:16:45.004
Are you waiting for an invitation? Beat him!

164
00:16:45.087 --> 00:16:46.839
Okay, follow him!

165
00:16:57.891 --> 00:16:58.934
Scumbag!

166
00:17:29.381 --> 00:17:30.215
Dovben

167
00:18:11.882 --> 00:18:12.716
Yes.

168
00:18:55.676 --> 00:18:58.929
CHUVUN

169
00:19:28.333 --> 00:19:31.378
"BAEKCHONG CONSTRUCTION"
TO OUR KOREAN PARTNERS

170
00:20:10.667 --> 00:20:12.002
What a tragedy.

171
00:20:13.629 --> 00:20:15.088
I still…

172
00:20:18.175 --> 00:20:19.968
had a lot to learn from him.

173
00:20:24.932 --> 00:20:26.058
My condolences.

174
00:20:45.994 --> 00:20:47.829
Treat the directors with respect.

175
00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:55.754
do you know something

176
00:20:58.465 --> 00:20:59.299
What?

177
00:21:00.801 --> 00:21:01.760
About what?

178
00:21:02.886 --> 00:21:03.720
About Mr. Nam.

179
00:21:03.804 --> 00:21:05.597
{\an8}CHWE SONG CHOL
MANAGER, "CHUVUN"

180
00:21:05.681 --> 00:21:06.682
Isn't that you?

181
00:21:10.978 --> 00:21:12.646
How can you say that?

182
00:21:13.689 --> 00:21:14.523
Mr. manager.

183
00:21:15.482 --> 00:21:16.900
Gi Seok was my friend.

184
00:21:17.734 --> 00:21:20.737
Friendship is more important than anything.
Including for "Chuvun".

185
00:21:20.821 --> 00:21:22.406
Well, of course he was a friend.

186
00:21:23.865 --> 00:21:26.118
You have betrayed your friends more than once.

187
00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:28.829
First you were one of us.

188
00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:31.456
Do newbies know about it?

189
00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:32.624
Father, the police...

190
00:21:33.792 --> 00:21:35.711
They say it was some minors.

191
00:21:38.672 --> 00:21:40.716
Don't make an elephant out of a fly.

192
00:21:44.219 --> 00:21:47.055
So you really are hiding something.

193
00:21:52.686 --> 00:21:53.812
Not worth it

194
00:21:54.688 --> 00:21:56.398
talk to me like that now.

195
00:22:00.902 --> 00:22:02.070
Prosecutor Lee.

196
00:22:08.744 --> 00:22:10.579
Have you left work before?

197
00:22:11.079 --> 00:22:12.789
Where is Mr. Nam's memorial hall?

198
00:22:14.124 --> 00:22:17.377
They must be tired.
Maybe you will go home to rest?

199
00:22:18.378 --> 00:22:19.421
Take him away.

200
00:22:20.339 --> 00:22:22.966
{\an8}ELDEST SON OF LEE JU WUN
LEE HYUM SONG

201
00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:25.177
Is this visit a business one for you?

202
00:22:28.347 --> 00:22:29.973
Mr. President of the company is there.

203
00:22:30.766 --> 00:22:31.725
And what?

204
00:22:39.149 --> 00:22:40.859
You know what he wants.

205
00:22:41.485 --> 00:22:44.488
He wants you to
did not participate in the company's affairs.

206
00:22:45.739 --> 00:22:48.492
It is only for you
attending the farewell ceremony,

207
00:22:49.701 --> 00:22:52.746
but for my people
everything will not end so quickly.

208
00:22:54.706 --> 00:22:57.626
I will talk to my father.
Please guide me.

209
00:22:59.086 --> 00:23:00.128
Song Cheol.

210
00:23:15.227 --> 00:23:16.937
This is Mr. Nam's brother.

211
00:23:17.437 --> 00:23:18.772
Pay him respect.

212
00:23:28.573 --> 00:23:29.408
where is he

213
00:23:31.410 --> 00:23:32.285
Gi Seok.

214
00:23:35.831 --> 00:23:37.290
Who did it?

215
00:23:41.002 --> 00:23:44.840
As I said, he got it
in a fight with young homeless people...

216
00:23:44.923 --> 00:23:46.091
Song Cheol.

217
00:23:50.220 --> 00:23:51.721
Is that all? Really?

218
00:24:03.400 --> 00:24:06.486
So what are you going to do?

219
00:24:08.113 --> 00:24:09.531
Nam Gi Seok is gone now.

220
00:24:10.532 --> 00:24:12.742
Look for another successor.

221
00:24:14.953 --> 00:24:18.999
Don't be so stubborn, give Geum Sung a chance.

222
00:24:19.749 --> 00:24:22.377
This is a good opportunity to support my son.

223
00:24:23.587 --> 00:24:25.088
What is good about it?

224
00:24:25.172 --> 00:24:28.216
do you think that
what happened to gi seok - is it good?

225
00:24:29.384 --> 00:24:31.219
Well, because

226
00:24:32.304 --> 00:24:33.430
I'm not talking about that.

227
00:24:33.513 --> 00:24:35.974
Gi Seok did not deserve to die like this.

228
00:24:42.981 --> 00:24:44.983
CHUVUN

229
00:24:45.066 --> 00:24:46.026
Gi Joon.

230
00:24:53.617 --> 00:24:55.243
what are you doing here

231
00:24:55.952 --> 00:24:58.163
You said to live as if I were already dead.

232
00:24:58.246 --> 00:25:01.541
But today I can't do that.

233
00:25:03.001 --> 00:25:04.211
Sorry.

234
00:25:05.212 --> 00:25:08.798
OK. I understand that
given the circumstances.

235
00:25:08.882 --> 00:25:11.843
Of course you must visit
his brother's funeral.

236
00:25:13.762 --> 00:25:16.056
Remember the agreement 11 years ago?

237
00:25:16.848 --> 00:25:18.016
Of course, I remember.

238
00:25:18.600 --> 00:25:20.936
You promised that we would not see you.

239
00:25:21.561 --> 00:25:22.687
Not that one.

240
00:25:25.148 --> 00:25:26.566
There was one more.

241
00:25:28.652 --> 00:25:31.446
I promised I wouldn't let
for Gi Seok to suffer.

242
00:25:31.530 --> 00:25:33.406
I kept my word

243
00:25:34.282 --> 00:25:37.410
but you didn't keep yours.

244
00:25:43.875 --> 00:25:45.502
- Gi Jun.
- Gi Seok's death...

245
00:25:48.129 --> 00:25:50.048
Is there anything else I should know?

246
00:25:50.715 --> 00:25:51.716
What?

247
00:25:54.469 --> 00:25:55.512
Nothing, no?

248
00:26:00.475 --> 00:26:01.851
I'll take it as no.

249
00:26:07.315 --> 00:26:10.068
Gi Jun.

250
00:26:19.828 --> 00:26:21.788
Sir! Gee Jun!

251
00:26:23.790 --> 00:26:25.208
are you leaving already?

252
00:26:32.299 --> 00:26:33.925
Allow me to introduce myself.

253
00:26:34.593 --> 00:26:37.262
I'm Jeong Hye Bum. I was Gi Seok's subordinate.

254
00:26:50.567 --> 00:26:51.735
I will make sure that…

255
00:26:53.528 --> 00:26:55.196
Gi Seok was duly honored.

256
00:27:43.078 --> 00:27:48.208
CAMPING AS A BUSINESS

257
00:27:48.291 --> 00:27:51.711
CAMPING

258
00:28:22.951 --> 00:28:24.577
NAM GI JUN

259
00:28:24.661 --> 00:28:25.787
CAMPING "CHONGSIN"

260
00:28:34.921 --> 00:28:38.717
HAPPY BIRTHDAY, GI JUN!
FROM GI JUICE

261
00:29:17.422 --> 00:29:18.506
I'm sorry.

262
00:29:19.174 --> 00:29:23.762
Relatives of victims are not allowed to visit him,
because he is suspected of a serious crime.

263
00:29:24.596 --> 00:29:26.097
I'm only for a little while.

264
00:29:26.848 --> 00:29:29.267
Those are the rules.

265
00:29:29.976 --> 00:29:31.102
I am very sorry.

266
00:29:33.438 --> 00:29:34.606
Well, you heard.

267
00:29:36.065 --> 00:29:38.443
I understand everything, but the investigation is ongoing.

268
00:29:38.526 --> 00:29:41.112
He is a suspect, but not yet proven guilty.

269
00:29:41.613 --> 00:29:44.449
I understand. I only
I ask permission to see him.

270
00:29:44.949 --> 00:29:47.202
Why do you need it?

271
00:29:47.786 --> 00:29:50.830
It's against the rules.
You're not even his relative.

272
00:29:51.456 --> 00:29:53.124
You are a relative of the victim.

273
00:29:53.625 --> 00:29:55.335
So when the trial begins,

274
00:29:55.418 --> 00:29:58.046
then you will see him whether you want it or not.

